<p id="Ax1.p24.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.p24.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_left ltx_inline-block" style="width:28.0pt;"><a href="#A6.SS3" title="F.3 Software and Execution Environment ‣ Appendix F Model and Run Details ‣ DLawBench: Evaluating LLMs Through Multi-Turn Legal Consultation" class="ltx_ref">F.3</a></span><a href="#A6.SS3" title="F.3 Software and Execution Environment ‣ Appendix F Model and Run Details ‣ DLawBench: Evaluating LLMs Through Multi-Turn Legal Consultation" class="ltx_ref">Software and Execution Environment</a><span id="Ax1.p24.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_leader">.</span><a href="#A6.SS3" title="F.3 Software and Execution Environment ‣ Appendix F Model and Run Details ‣ DLawBench: Evaluating LLMs Through Multi-Turn Legal Consultation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">F.3</span></a></p>
