<span id="A1.T8.2.27.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">I9</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.27.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.27.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:34.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.27.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Inquiry</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.27.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;" colspan="2">
<span id="A1.T8.2.27.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:272.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.27.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Ask what materials supported the 2019 registration, including gift documents, resettlement files, or family-member statements.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.28" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;">
