<span id="A1.T8.2.29.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">I11</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.29.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.29.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:34.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.29.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Inquiry</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.29.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;" colspan="2">
<span id="A1.T8.2.29.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:272.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.29.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Ask for the dates, locations, withdrawal accounts, third-party witnesses, receipt originals, and formation time for the alleged RMB 710,000 and RMB 200,000 cash deliveries.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.30" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.30.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;">
