<span id="A1.T8.2.30.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">I12</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.30.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.30.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:34.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.30.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Inquiry</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.30.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;" colspan="2">
<span id="A1.T8.2.30.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:272.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.30.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Ask which property was rented, lease terms, rent standards, collected amounts, expense deductions and supporting records, and how the RMB 76,100 balance was calculated.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.31" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.31.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.31.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.31.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">I13</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.31.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.31.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:34.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.31.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Inquiry</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.31.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;" colspan="2">
<span id="A1.T8.2.31.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:272.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.31.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Ask which unit issued the RMB 5,000 funeral benefit, on what basis, whether it was spent on burial expenses, and whether receipts exist.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.32" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.32.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 2.0pt;">
