<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span>Client-Style Performance by Model</h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figures <a href="#A2.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ B.4 Client-Style Performance by Model ‣ Appendix B Additional Diagnostic Results ‣ DLawBench: Evaluating LLMs Through Multi-Turn Legal Consultation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>–<a href="#A2.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ B.4 Client-Style Performance by Model ‣ Appendix B Additional Diagnostic Results ‣ DLawBench: Evaluating LLMs Through Multi-Turn Legal Consultation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> report client-style sensitivity for each evaluated lawyer model. Scores average Chinese-law and U.S.-law cases, and each figure separates the four client narrative styles used in <span id="A2.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">DLawBench</span>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.13931v1/elicitation_style.png" id="A2.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/234;" width="476" height="234" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Elicitation by client narrative style for 26 lawyer models. Scores average Chinese-law and U.S.-law cases across the four client styles.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.13931v1/resolution_style.png" id="A2.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/235;" width="476" height="235" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Resolution by client narrative style for 26 lawyer models. Scores average Chinese-law and U.S.-law cases across the four client styles.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.13931v1/fidelity_style.png" id="A2.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/235;" width="476" height="235" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Fidelity by client narrative style for 26 lawyer models. Scores average Chinese-law and U.S.-law cases across the four client styles.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
