<div id="A7.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Issue Resolution and Inquiry require case-specific professional judgments about whether a memo or dialogue satisfies each rubric item. The high agreement on these rubric dimensions supports the binary item-level rubrics in Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Prompt Engineering ‣ DLawBench: Evaluating LLMs Through Multi-Turn Legal Consultation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a> and the use of panel verdicts as reliable measurements of legal analysis and professional intake quality.</p>
</div>
